      "widgets_values": [
        "=== FLUX PORTRAIT v1 ===\n\nMODELS NEEDED (place in correct folders):\n\nmodels/diffusion_models/\n  flux1-dev-Q5_K_S.gguf\n  (~9.5GB GGUF \u2014 fits 16GB VRAM with LoRAs)\n\nmodels/vae/\n  ae.safetensors\n  (from black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev)\n\nmodels/clip/\n  t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n  clip_l.safetensors\n  (from comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders)\n\nmodels/loras/flux/\n  FLUX-dev-lora-add_details.safetensors\n  FLUX-dev-lora-AntiBlur.safetensors\n  (from Shakker-Labs on HuggingFace)\n\nCUSTOM NODES (via ComfyUI Manager):\n  ComfyUI-GGUF\n  ComfyUI_SUNoise\n\nSETTINGS:\n  Resolution: 896x1152 (portrait)\n  Steps: 20 | Sampler: euler\n  Scheduler: beta | Guidance: 3.5\n  Seed: 42 (change to randomize)\n\nFACE FIX (optional, add after):\n  Install Impact Pack, then add\n  FaceDetailer after VAEDecode.\n  Use denoise 0.30-0.40 on face crop."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
